        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wot Kaleb m’umin Yeramel gi Meca ma kayu pare, ma en e won Zif; man wot Mareca ma won Hebron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wot Hebron gi eni: Kora, man Tapua, man Rekem, man Cema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Cema nyolo Raham, ma won Yorkeam; man Rekem unyolo Camai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wod Camai en e Maon; man Maon en e won Beth-zur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Efa dhaku m’araga pa Kaleb, unyolo Haran, man Moza ku Gazez; man Haran unyolo Gazez. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man wot Yadai gi eni: Regem, man Yothan, man Gecan, man Pelet, man Efa, man Caf. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maka, ma dhaku m’araga pa Kaleb, unyolo Ceber man Tirhana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 2:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enyolo Caf ma won Madmana bende, Ceva ma won Makbena, man won Gibeya; man nya Kaleb en e Aksa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.2.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.2.49"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
